COMMENT     The annotation was added by the assembly submitters using the NCBI
            Prokaryotic Genome Annotation Pipeline (PGAP). Information about
            stand-alone PGAP can be found here: https://github.com/ncbi/pgap/
            This draft WGS assembly was generated by running SKESA to generate
            a de-novo assembly. The de-novo assembly was then concatenated with
            contigs generated using the SAUTE guided assembler with
            antimicrobial resistance genes and Stx operons as baits to increase
            sensitivity and specificity for those genes. Note, contigs derived
            from the SAUTE guided assembly may overlap de-novo contigs from
            SKESA, and/or other SAUTE contigs. De-novo contigs can be
            differentiated from guided assembler contigs by their names, which
            include either 'denovo' or 'guided'.
            
